# WARP-8: GLO held, the keys mute from any page and its release opens no page: black keys the drums, white 1-3 the
# tracks, white 15 clears them all. KNOB 1 with GLO held: a mute waits for the bar line while it plays
wait 300
listen
expect trk 1
expect page Steps
press GLO
tapkey b0
tapkey b4
tapkey w2
release GLO
wait 40
expect page Steps
expect kmute 17
expect mute 4
press GLO
tapkey w14
release GLO
wait 40
said MUTES
expect kmute 0
expect mute 0
expect page Steps
# at the bar: asked while it plays, nothing until the bar line; then the mute
press GLO
turn K1 1
release GLO
wait 40
said MUTES
expect page Steps
tap PLAY
wait 300
press GLO
tapkey b1
tapkey w1
release GLO
wait 40
expect kmute 0
expect mute 0
wait 2200
expect kmute 2
expect mute 2
# and back, waiting again; a stop takes what still waits
press GLO
tapkey b1
release GLO
wait 40
expect kmute 2
tap PLAY
wait 100
expect kmute 0
# at once again
press GLO
turn K1 -1
tapkey b2
release GLO
wait 40
expect kmute 4
expect page Steps
